WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,300
Your sister-in-law is pregnant, and I don't have time to interfere with this, so I might as well spend more time with her.

2
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:10,300
What happened this time was a natural disaster as well as a man-made disaster. Although our Song family will not get involved, we must do something.

3
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:11,300
What do you mean?

4
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:13,300
No shame or damage needs to be repaired.

5
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:16,300
The displaced victims need to be resettled, and what they are most lacking right now is silver.

6
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:20,300
Our Song family doesn't understand court games, so we still have some money.

7
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:23,300
It is not difficult to take out part of Yinjiang Intercontinental.

8
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:26,300
First of all, it is to put some effort into appeasing the local people's minds.

9
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:28,300
Secondly, it also paves the way for our own family.

10
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:33,300
The current situation is turbulent, but when it stabilizes, our trade routes will remain peaceful for a long time.

11
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:39,300
My mother always thought before that when you marry into the Marquis Mansion, your whole heart will be devoted to others.

12
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:43,300
I'm afraid someone else is really suffering.

13
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:45,300
It would be nice for my sister-in-law and Brother Cheng to come in.

14
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:48,300
It's very good. I can eat and sleep. Brother Cheng is also good.

15
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:51,300
It's just that I've been bleeding a lot these past few days, and I'm a little bored at home.

16
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:54,300
It's almost time, let's go and see Chi'er.
